WEBVTT

01
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.880
I'm your camera's assistant.

02
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.160
You frame the shot. I'll handle the exposure.

03
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:16.300
Twenty-four times a second, I read the picture. In stops. Like a DP.

04a
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:17.170
Sensor.

04b
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:18.470
Iris.

04c
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:19.700
Color.

05
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.100
Only inside the ranges you approve.

06
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.100
October 19. A real FX2.

07
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.300
Two and a half stops hot. Coming down a third.

08
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.710
Exposure good. Holding.

09
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:39.530
Interview look. Shutter, 1/48. Iris, f/4. White balance, 2800.

10
00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:46.900
Every change is logged. Old value, new value, and why.

11
00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:49.650
Want it back? One key.

12
00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:52.250
Stopped. 33 milliseconds. It's yours.

13
00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:58.440
Next: a blind test. Me, the camera's own auto, and a human.

14
00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:03.940
Exposure… handled.
